There are quite a lot of monsters that can give you poison resistance
at no risk. More specifically, all monsters that have poison resistance
but whose corpses are not poisonous. From the sources, these are:

the Arch Priest, Hippocrates, Pelias, Thoth Amon, the Wizard of Yendor,
acid blob, attendant, barbarian, black naga hatchling, black naga,
black pudding, black unicorn, blue jelly, brown mold, brown pudding,
cave spider, chieftain, flesh golem, gelatinous cube, golden naga
hatchling, golden naga, gray ooze, gray unicorn, guardian naga
hatchling, healer, high priest, nurse, quasit, quivering blob, red
mold, red naga hatchling, red naga, shrieker, tengu, violet fungus,
white unicorn, wraith.

These monsters are all non-poisonous, but since they *are* poison
resistant, they still can confer poison resistance to you.

Note that there are three more, namely the coackatrice, Death, Famine,
and Pestilence, but I would advise against eating them...

